                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page48');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page48",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "Oho. Right enough. The graffiti in the art museum and the theft of the Trainers' Poké Balls?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page49');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page49",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "All me, controlling Essentia remotely with the Expansion Suit!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page50');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page50",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "Emma was clinically unconscious in the suit."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page51');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page51",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "Her mind had no clue what her body was doing."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page52');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page52",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "She has zero responsibility for any of the crimes. You need not doubt her."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page53');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page53",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "That's how it is?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page54');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page54",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "If you're apprehending anyone, it should be me alone."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page55');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page55",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Ahem. For a minute, let's say I believe your statements--"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page56');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page56",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "You had better believe it. Emma is a fine person."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page57');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page57",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "She may be a bit foolish, but she's strong and clear in purpose."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page58');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page58",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "Yes, clarity... It is required when one dedicates oneself to a single pursuit."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page59');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page59",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "Clarity of heart and of purpose is needed if work such as my research is to succeed."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page60');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page60",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "The Expansion Suit that I dreamed of could have only been created thanks to the clear dedication of that girl's heart."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page61');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page61",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "When you add that all up, it means..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page62');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page62",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "That I have no regrets. Take me away, Officer."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run tp @s -5.50 105.00 423.50 -43.35 48.80');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page63');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page63",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "I hear you. Once I have everything in order, I will ask you to accompany me to the station."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page64');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page64",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "And that is all I have to say to you as Looker of the International Police."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page65');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page65",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "What I say to you now, I say as simply Mr. Looker, young Emma's guardian..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page66');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page66",
            "speaker": "xerosic",
            "lines": [
                "Hm?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page67');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page67",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Would you care to stay and visit a while longer with Emma and me?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page68');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page68",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "She seems to have grown quite fond of you, you know."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page69');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page69",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "We are about to have dinner together, and she was hoping you would join us."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page70');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page70",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Ahem... I would like to wait until tomorrow,"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page71');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page71",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "after she has enjoyed a last cheerful night, before I must tell her the truth."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page72');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
